date-released: 2026-10-08
repository-code: "https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds"
url: "https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds"
abstract: >-
  Community research on integer multiplication with conditional kappa =
  25508460085039/500000000000000000 > 2^-15. Avi Eisenberg's interval strips
  and core-aware pair assembly combine with eumemic's joint frame compiler
  and Alejandro Zarzuelo Urdiales's exact parameter refinement. Includes
  attributed alternative constructions, exact finite certificates, scoped
  Lean checks and a conditional maintainer audit. The original OpenAI #109
  framework remains assumed. No full formal verification, independent human
  peer review or worldwide priority is claimed.
